The '''Lowlands''' was a region on the [[planet]] [[Aldhani]]. The [[Enterprise Zone]] was located in the Lowlands, along with most of the world's [[Dhani|native population]]. The rebel [[spy]] [[Lieutenant]] [[Gorn]] wanted to refocus the [[Aldhani Garrison]]'s attention to the Lowlands as a distraction.<ref name="Aldhani" />

When the Dhanis that lived in the Lowlands were forcibly moved to the new Enterprise Zone by the [[Galactic Empire]], few lived outside of the zone, mainly [[ghoat-herder]]s.<ref name="Aldhani" />

